# CAPTURE, taken to the limit: one actor writes the source, supplies the
# evidence, reviews it, hears the challenge, stands as the independent
# alternate, and is the body doing the restricting. Every seat, one person.
# Nothing completes. The separation requirements are conditions on the
# supplied credentials, so this establishes that the record refuses the
# arrangement — not that any real body is independent.

:expect-pins 4

? complete(KnowledgeCaseRecord, ReviewedKnowledgeRestriction, KnowledgeCaseMatter).
# => FALSE
? authority(CaptureBoss, ReviewedConductRestriction, KnowledgeCaseRecord).
# => FALSE
? obliged(CaptureBoss, PublishKnowledgeRestrictionReasonsAndEvidence, KnowledgeCaseRecord).
# => FALSE
? obliged(CaptureBoss, HearKnowledgeRestrictionChallengeAndCorrect, KnowledgeCaseRecord).
# => FALSE
